      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-which-modules-can-we-start-with"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Which modules can we start with?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Your first modules</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq5"><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Sales orders and delivery orders</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Inventory: stock, bins and counts</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Purchasing and approvals</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Reports from live numbers</p><p class="x"><em>+</em>1 standard integration with Connected</p></div></div></div><p>Most teams start with sales orders and inventory, then add purchasing, approvals and reporting. Essentials covers 1 standard module, Operations up to 3 with approval and reporting scope, and Connected up to 5 plus 1 standard integration, such as your online shop or Google Sheets.</p></div></div></article>
